  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Resilient Agricultural-Centered Private Sector Economic Development (GRAPE 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overall Objective&lt;/strong&gt; is to advance sustainable climate-resilient private sector development in the agriculture sector in Nepal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific Objective 1&lt;/strong&gt; (outcome 1) of the Action is to expand profitable, innovative, sustainable and equitable climate-resilient agricultural value chains that support youth and women&#xbf;s economic empowerment and equality.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific Objective 2&lt;/strong&gt; (outcome 2) of the Action is to support local governments in their commitments and practices for climate-resilient, nature-positive economic development in Nepal, with a focus on Karnali, Sudurpaschim and Koshi provinces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 1 on Business Development Services:&lt;/strong&gt; Women and youth-led enterprises have access to inclusive and high-quality business development services&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 2 on Value Chain Development and Market Access&lt;/strong&gt;: Climate-resilient value chains, market linkages and market access are developed through partnerships that empower women and youth economically&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 3 on Economic Governance&lt;/strong&gt;: Municipal and provincial governments are strengthened to promote climate-resilient and inclusive economic development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 4 on Changing Mindsets&lt;/strong&gt;: Key stakeholders in the Nepali entrepreneurial ecosystem respect and value women&#xbf;s contribution to economic development&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output 5 on Scaling&lt;/strong&gt;: Good practices, products and services that support gender-transformative and climate-resilient market development are upscaled.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
